                  \\Lambda[2]^\infty_D:=(\Lambda\hookrightarrow C^\infty(-,\mathbb{R}^n)\xrightarrow{d_\Lambda} \Omega^1(-,\mathbb{R}^n)),
          %p
            where the differential
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi d
                    %mi Λ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d_\Lambda
            is defined as follows: if
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi e
