          %p
            (this is independent of the chosen basis). The definition of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi d
                    %mi Λ
