                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \to \mathbf{B} \mathbb{R}^n / \Lambda \times \mathbf{B} \mathbb{R}^n / \hat \Lambda
              of a pair of torus bundles
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
