                      %mi τ
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ˜
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \tilde \tau
              here is the class on the fiber product in question.
            %p
              Notice that in the top left we indeed have
              = succeed ":" do
